{"id":"8175e0e33cb0689c","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_BinaryValue.md","title":"BinaryValue","display":"BinaryValue","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"BinaryValue","parameters":["f","a","b","c"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"BinaryValue"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>f</span><span>a</span><span>b</span><span>c</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：Heyting 代数语义。有序参数：<code>f</code>、<code>a</code>、<code>b</code>、<code>c</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ BinaryValue f a b c)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists p (and (@ Pair a b p) (@ App f p c)))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ BinaryValue f a b c)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Pair","status":"resolved","id":"0a7fe33bb2e95221","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":790,"backlinks":[{"id":"23fc3019079f617c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_Antisymmetric|Antisymmetric]]；[[ZFC_BinaryOperation|BinaryOperation]]；[[ZFC_BinaryValue|BinaryValue]]；[[ZFC_Edge|Edge]]；[[ZFC_Nonempty|Nonempty]]；[[ZFC_Reflexive|Reflexive]]；[[ZFC_RelationOn|RelationOn]]；[[ZFC_Transitive|Transitive]]"},{"id":"2aa4d78fd855f99c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_BinaryValue|BinaryValue]]；[[ZFC_FmH|FmH]]；[[ZFC_HeytingAlgebra|HeytingAlgebra]]；[[ZFC_Map|Map]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_PAnd|PAnd]]；[[ZFC_PAtom|PAtom]]；[[ZFC_PBot|PBot]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_POr|POr]]；[[ZFC_PTop|PTop]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-744","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_BinaryValue|BinaryValue]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","8bd25e131370b9c4","0a7fe33bb2e95221","593f9bdab4d60707"]}